sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as API caller
    participant RequestLog as Request log, fixed
    participant AnswerFailures as Answer failures, fixed
    participant Auth as API middleware
    participant Endpoint as Route of the contract
    participant Log as Command middleware
    participant Access as Command middleware
    participant Batch as Command middleware
    participant Handler as Command handler

    Caller->>+RequestLog: a request
    RequestLog->>+AnswerFailures: the request
    AnswerFailures->>+Auth: the request
    Note over Auth: a step that needs the transport, a sample
    Auth->>+Endpoint: the route of the contract
    Endpoint->>+Log: the command
    Log->>+Access: the command
    Note over Access: a step for every API, a sample
    Access->>+Batch: the command
    Note over Batch: the last of the list runs next to the handler
    Batch->>+Handler: the command
    Handler-->>-Batch: the result
    Batch-->>-Access: the result
    Access-->>-Log: the result
    Log-->>-Endpoint: the result
    Endpoint-->>-Auth: 200 with JSON
    Auth-->>-AnswerFailures: the answer
    AnswerFailures-->>-RequestLog: a rejection at any step arrives here as google.rpc.Status
    RequestLog-->>-Caller: the answer
